WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:01.950
- One of our favorite ways to connect

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:04.030
is with healthy competition.

00:00:04.030 --> 00:00:05.110
And if you know me,

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:07.710
you know I love to play and win games.

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:09.790
'Cause it's just what I do.

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:12.540
So every once in a while we
need another host to step in.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:14.590
I can't play and host.

00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:16.350
Luckily we've said our prayers

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:18.430
and know a guy in a rather high position.

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:20.470
He's the biggest star in the galaxy.

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:21.820
You know his work well because,

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:23.340
well, it's all around you.

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:24.750
Voice of God, are you there?

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:25.640
It's me, Kelly.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:26.473
- [Voice] I am.

00:00:26.473 --> 00:00:27.460
Hello Kelly.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:29.230
Nice to see you again.

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:30.437
(clapping)

00:00:30.437 --> 00:00:33.190
- It's so awesome every
time you're on the show,

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:34.780
I love you so much.

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:36.520
So I know you know Jason Derulo.

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:38.400
Obviously, you know all of your children.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:39.500
- [Voice] Of course I do.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:40.740
Hello, my son.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:41.780
You know, I have to tell you,

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:45.262
I just love your work
as a little kitty cat.

00:00:45.262 --> 00:00:46.469
- Oh, thanks.

00:00:46.469 --> 00:00:47.436
Thank you, God.

00:00:47.436 --> 00:00:48.930
Thank you. (laughs)

00:00:48.930 --> 00:00:50.220
- All right, well, voice of God,

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:51.720
you have been on the show

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:53.630
a couple of times now in season one.

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:56.270
So what about connection
is important to you?

00:00:56.270 --> 00:00:57.290
- [Voice] Well, take it from me,

00:00:57.290 --> 00:01:00.650
connecting with other people
in this world is everything.

00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:03.360
And I should know because I made it.

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:05.490
- I made it.
(laughter)

00:01:05.490 --> 00:01:08.470
All right, well voice of God,
will you help us with a game?

00:01:08.470 --> 00:01:09.570
- [Voice] You bet I will, Kelly.

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:10.967
Now this game here is called

00:01:10.967 --> 00:01:13.299
"Dear God, what's the connection?"

00:01:13.299 --> 00:01:16.132
(celestial music)

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:19.480
Okay, now the rules are,

00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:22.120
I will give the names
of two famous people.

00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:25.060
Now it's your job to tell
me what connects the two.

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:25.950
So for example,

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:28.640
if I said Tim Allen and Tom Hanks,

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:30.597
you would say--
- "Toy Story" oh, wait.

00:01:30.597 --> 00:01:31.950
- "Toy Story"
- [Voice] That's right,

00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:33.010
we're not playing yet, Kelly.

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:33.843
But you got it--
- I know, I got,

00:01:33.843 --> 00:01:35.530
I get very excited, God, you know this.

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:37.750
- [Voice] Yes, you won the tryout round.

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:38.730
Now, here we go.
(laughter)

00:01:38.730 --> 00:01:43.210
Whoever raises their hand first
will be called on to guess.

00:01:43.210 --> 00:01:45.710
Now, a correct guess will get a point.

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:48.570
But an incorrect guess
will send you straight

00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:50.360
to you know where.

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:51.780
- Dang!
(laughter)

00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:53.840
- [Voice] No, I'm just playing.

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:55.020
Now, if you guess wrong,

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:56.970
the other person gets to guess.

00:01:56.970 --> 00:01:58.120
Most points wins.

00:01:58.120 --> 00:01:59.956
Okay, now how does that sound?

00:01:59.956 --> 00:02:01.030
- It sounds great.
- It sounds good.

00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:02.470
- [Voice] All right, let's get started.

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:04.980
Here is your first connection.

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:08.293
Will Smith and Tyra banks.

00:02:09.273 --> 00:02:10.890
- Oh, I got nothing.

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:11.723
- Me neither.

00:02:11.723 --> 00:02:12.556
Wait,

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:15.240
- Will Smith and Tyra Banks.

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:16.800
- [Voice] Okay, Kelly raised her hand.

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:17.870
What you got?

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:19.492
- Was she on "Fresh Prince of Bel Air"?

00:02:19.492 --> 00:02:21.303
- [Voice] That is correct--
- What! Yes!

00:02:25.684 --> 00:02:26.550
Oh, I love that show.

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:28.140
- I love that show too,

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:28.973
how did I miss that?

00:02:28.973 --> 00:02:30.110
- I mean, I didn't remember that.

00:02:30.110 --> 00:02:32.010
I just kinda assumed maybe it was that.

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:32.950
I was like, yeah.

00:02:32.950 --> 00:02:34.902
- Tyra Banks was in "Fresh Prince."

00:02:34.902 --> 00:02:35.840
- I feel like everybody was,

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:37.210
