points and Kelly has one.

00:02:41.934 --> 00:02:43.242
(laughter)

00:02:43.242 --> 00:02:44.150
Let's tighten that up.

00:02:44.150 --> 00:02:45.241
Okay now.

00:02:45.241 --> 00:02:46.074
(mumbles)

00:02:46.074 --> 00:02:47.100
You got a chance to come back.

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.080
Here is your next connection.

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:51.410
- Okay.
- [Voice] Meryl Streep

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:53.293
